    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d793">

                <pb facs="0876" n="790" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg790"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-12-09"><hi rendition="#italic">December 9,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen reports that he has received a note from the Venezuelan Government
                    stating that it believes its differences with Great Britain and Germany can be
                    settled by arbitration and asking Mr. Bowen to be arbitrator representing
                    Venezuela. Mr. Bowen requests an immediate reply.</p>
                <p>Combined British and German fleets captured to-day all Venezuelan war vessels in
                    the harbor of La Guaira and probably in other ports.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
